<Base {title} {description} lang="en" altPath="terms"><section class="section"><article class="shell legal max-w-4xl"><h1 class="section-title">Terms of use</h1><p>Reviewed: 23 October 2026</p><h2>Independent guide</h2><p>This is an independent English information site; it is not an official representative of the operators of Golghar, the Patna district administration or Bihar Tourism. This site does not sell tickets or tours and does not make reservations.</p><h2>Limits of the information</h2><p>Historical sources and a dated map listing are not a guarantee of current entry. Hours, fees, access to the stairs and facilities can change. The site’s current instructions and official information come first.</p><h2>Weather and planning</h2><p>The build-time snapshot and the browser-refreshed weather are forecasts. Check the provider time. No conclusion about the site being open or closed is drawn from weather conditions. Unavailable information must not be shown as the current weather.</p><h2>Original images and text</h2><p>The SVG drawings are original illustrative images made for this guide; they are not photographs or measured plans. Do not use them to confirm the current structure, access or facilities. The names and links of other organisations are for identifying sources.</p><h2>Preparing your own trip</h2><p>Choose your route according to where you start, your pace and your needs. Check the availability of parking, transport, toilets or any other service separately. Do not rely on a fixed fee, entry or service without confirming it first.</p><p><a href="/en/cookies/">Cookie settings</a> · <a href="/en/">Main guide</a></p></article></section></Base>
